{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wgc-e-8-e2","title":"邵悌谏勿专任钟会伐蜀","order":5825,"accounts":[{"id":"wgc-a-8-e2","label":"正文","text":"邵悌谏勿专任钟会伐蜀","evidence":["wgc-q0511","wgc-q0084"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wgc-p0056","role":"求见、谏会单身无重任不若使他人行","evidence":["wgc-q0511","wgc-q0084"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原纪年逐项对读；不从邻段继承绝对年份。","evidence":["wgc-q0511","wgc-q0084"]},"ordering_evidence":"wgc-q0511"},{"id":"wgc-e-8-e4","title":"会白艾不轨文王将西悌复谏","order":5827,"accounts":[{"id":"wgc-a-8-e4","label":"正文","text":"会白艾不轨文王将西悌复谏","evidence":["wgc-q0513","wgc-q0085"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wgc-p0056","role":"复言但可敕会取艾不足自行","evidence":["wgc-q0513","wgc-q0085"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0045","role":"将西行并听邵悌劝阻","evidence":["wgc-q0513","wgc-q0085"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原纪年逐项对读；不从邻段继承绝对年份。","evidence":["wgc-q0513","wgc-q0085"]},"ordering_evidence":"wgc-q0513"}],"persons":[{"id":"wgc-p0056","name":"邵悌","evidence":["wgc-q0084","wgc-q0137","wgc-q0085"],"aliases":[],"facts":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wgc-m-o114-wgc-p0056","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及邵悌","evidence":["wgc-q0084"]},{"id":"wgc-m-p062-wgc-p0056","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及邵悌","evidence":["wgc-q0137"]},{"id":"wgc-m-o115-wgc-p0056","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及邵悌","evidence":["wgc-q0085"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wgc-q0084","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-4ba4c027891765d3cd60","layer":"original","quote":"初，文王欲遣会伐蜀，西曹属邵悌求见曰：“今遣钟会率十余万众伐蜀，愚谓会单身无重任〖9〗，不若使余人行。”文王笑曰：“我宁当复不知此耶〖10〗！蜀为天下作患，使民不得安息；我今伐之如指掌耳〖11〗，而众人皆言蜀不可伐。夫人心预怯，则智勇并竭；智勇并竭而强使之，适为敌擒耳。惟钟会与人意同，今遣会伐蜀，必可灭蜀。灭蜀之后，就如卿所虑，当何所能一办耶〖12〗？凡败军之将，不可以语勇；亡国之大夫，可与图存：心胆已破故也。若蜀已破，遗民震恐，不足与图事；中国将士各自思归〖13〗，不肯与同也。若作恶，只自灭族耳！卿不须忧此，慎莫使人闻也！”","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":597,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":266,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0085","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-0b9429010b4ab5a9ea4f","layer":"original","quote":"及会白邓艾不轨，文王将西，悌复曰：“钟会所统，五六倍于邓艾；但可敕会取艾，不足自行。”文王曰：“卿忘前时所言邪？而更云可不须行乎！虽尔，此言不可宣也。我要自当以信义待人〖14〗，但人不当负我，我岂可先人生心哉！近日贾护军问我〖15〗，言：‘颇疑钟会不？’我答言：‘如今遣卿行，宁可复疑卿邪？’贾亦无以易我语也〖16〗。我到长安，则自了矣。”军至长安，会果已死，咸如所策。﹝三﹞","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":598,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":188,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0137","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-b80bbdb9cc4b358ceafa","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞按《咸熙元年百官名》：“邵悌，字元伯，阳平人。”","attribution":"咸熙元年百官名","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":619,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-b8c46d3147cdc6a86a2c","start":0,"end":27,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0511","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-4ba4c027891765d3cd60","layer":"original","quote":"西曹属邵悌求见曰：“今遣钟会率十余万众伐蜀，愚谓会单身无重任〖9〗，不若使余人行","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":597,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":10,"end":50,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0513","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-0b9429010b4ab5a9ea4f","layer":"original","quote":"及会白邓艾不轨，文王将西，悌复曰：“钟会所统，五六倍于邓艾；但可敕会取艾，不足自行","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":598,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":41,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
